           k      Bi  R_eff mOhm  surf RMSE  CORE RMSE
      0.3000   1.594     14.4604     0.5400     1.8181
      0.3500   1.366     14.3641     0.4927     1.0949
      0.3908   1.223     14.3040     0.4637     0.8895
